   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Group's performance will be significantly influenced by the evolution in forward fund liquidity over the coming months and, while it is possible to deliver year-on-year progress in FY25, this will require market conditions to improve at a faster pace as we enter the new financial year.",
   "file": "20250123_WJG_Full-Year-Results-2024.md"
