   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Whilst the adverse movement in the UK interest rate outlook since early March has created greater uncertainty with regards to future transactional liquidity conditions, the Group will continue to be agile in optimising its pipeline whilst continuing to diversify its revenue streams.",
